en:
When you scraped Urna's name from Contrachio
and wrote Fiona's name in its place,
for an instant the land was wrapped in silence.{w}{p}And then...{w}

You sensed a warm light from the stone tablet before you.{w}It poured down upon you, as though it were
Fiona's own words of thanks.{w}{p}Finas Rade had been protected,
by your hands.{w}

